{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1194432-chambers-in-another-person-s-oneiros","id":1194432,"title":"Chambers in another person's Oneiros?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-11T20:52:50-07:00","id":1194432,"title":"Chambers in another person's Oneiros?","content":"I just had a thought. Is it possible for a Beast to form and claim a chamber in someone else's Oneiros? What would be the consequences of this? It seems like a great way to torment someone you despise, or stay close to someone you don't - provided the Horror can somehow be kept from snacking on that person. Maybe a loyal cultist would gladly take on the burden of being their God's living vessel. This has possibilities if it can be done. <br /> <br /> Thoughts? Ideas? I can see some story fodder, here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T23:35:43-07:00","id":1194451,"title":"","content":"You can claim an area in someone's Oneiros as the basis for a Chamber same way you can claim a location in the physical world, but all it does is make a copy of that landscape into the Primordial Dream - which because it doesn't have a physical analog, means it winds up in the Mists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T06:35:25-07:00","id":1194509,"title":"","content":"What are the mists?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Wait, I think these might be in Beast or the Player's Guide.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Yep, they are. Am I allowed to explain them here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 03-12-2018, 09:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T10:23:16-07:00","id":1194567,"title":"","content":"So you can't use a chamber of a nonphysical realm to enter into a nonphysical realm?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T11:24:31-07:00","id":1194582,"title":"","content":"I was thinking more along the lines of what kind of effect it might have on the person whose Oneiros you just stuck part of a nightmare realm in. I suppose 'it sinks into the mist' is a fair answer, albeit a boring one and a missed opportunity. Oh well.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T14:44:38-07:00","id":1194634,"title":"","content":"I fear you might be approaching this from the wrong angle. When a Chamber forms it always forms within the Primordial Dream. Beasts sense &quot;Chambers&quot; in the Waking World because they can sense that a Chamber within the Primordial Dream resonates with a location within the Waking World. What this means is that a Chamber made from part of someone's Oneiros would still be linked to said metaphysical location, but the Chamber would exist solely within the Mists since it doesn't have a suitable reflection within the Waking World. <br /> <br /> In other words, if you leave such a Chamber you'll just be deposited into the Mists. But, that Chamber would be especially easier to connect via Primordial Passage to said person's Oneiros. (Or so I believe, this is merely what I took from the material.) <br /> <br /> That being said, the Oneiros is ever shifting and changing so it's possible the part you make a Chamber in might phase out of existence due to the personal and spiritual growth of that individual. I would imagine if someone does use a Oneiros Chamber to make a Primordial Passage the target would interpret it as a vivid re-occurring nightmare since the Chamber would still reflect the original dream/idea that spawned the Chamber.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T00:07:02-07:00","id":1194753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1194432-chambers-in-another-person-s-oneiros?p=1194634#post1194634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I fear you might be approaching this from the wrong angle. When a Chamber forms it always forms within the Primordial Dream. Beasts sense &quot;Chambers&quot; in the Waking World because they can sense that a Chamber within the Primordial Dream resonates with a location within the Waking World. What this means is that a Chamber made from part of someone's Oneiros would still be linked to said metaphysical location, but the Chamber would exist solely within the Mists since it doesn't have a suitable reflection within the Waking World.<br /> <br /> In other words, if you leave such a Chamber you'll just be deposited into the Mists. But, that Chamber would be especially easier to connect via Primordial Passage to said person's Oneiros. (Or so I believe, this is merely what I took from the material.)<br /> <br /> That being said, the Oneiros is ever shifting and changing so it's possible the part you make a Chamber in might phase out of existence due to the personal and spiritual growth of that individual. I would imagine if someone does use a Oneiros Chamber to make a Primordial Passage the target would interpret it as a vivid re-occurring nightmare since the Chamber would still reflect the original dream/idea that spawned the Chamber.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This was my thought, too. I could see a devoted Herald or other cult member being willing to let a Beast draw from their own Nightmares to form a Chamber. Definitely something to explore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T04:27:47-07:00","id":1194792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1194432-chambers-in-another-person-s-oneiros?p=1194567#post1194567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you can't use a chamber of a nonphysical realm to enter into a nonphysical realm?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can actually use a Chamber of a physical realm to enter into a nonphysical realm. What matters is how close a place is to your Lair, and not even whether you know of it or where it is. Those factors just make it difficult to find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}